package wamn:engine@0.1.0;

/// Host-side bindgen world for the three host imports of the http-route
/// ingress guest. The host IMPLEMENTS `wamn:flow-http-routing/routing`, serving
/// routes out of the loaded release, and `wamn:router-delivery/delivery`, which
/// hands each request to the host's delivery. See src/flow_http_routing.rs and
/// src/router_delivery.rs. Each host implements `wamn:operation/operation`
/// over its own store; this world only generates the binding. See
/// src/entry_operation.rs.
world route-plugins {
  import wamn:flow-http-routing/routing@0.1.0;
  import wamn:router-delivery/delivery@0.4.0;
  import wamn:operation/operation@0.1.0;
}
